{title: You Are My Hiding Place (FJ_122_en)}
{subtitle: Du bist mein Zufluchtsort · No. 122}
{song_number: 122}
{key: Am}
{tempo: 98}
{language: en}
{comment: Two-part round}

[Am]You are my [Dm]hiding place. [G]You always
[C]fill my heart with [F]songs of de[Dm]liverance when-
[Esus4]ever I am a[E7]fraid. I will trust in [Am]You.
[Dm]I will trust in [G]You; [C]let the weak say:
[F]“I am [Dm]strong in the [Esus4]strength [E7]of my [Am]God.”
